## 1. Purpose

StockSense is provided solely for **educational, academic, demonstration, portfolio, and viewing purposes**.

This project demonstrates the design and implementation of an Inventory Management System, including inventory tracking, stock operations, authentication, dashboards, warehouse management, database integration, and real-time application functionality.

